@startuml
actor "Persona adulta mayor" as Resident
participant "PWA residente" as Pwa
participant "Emergency API" as Api
database "emergency_db" as Db
participant "Panel / móvil" as Caregiver
participant "ETL Worker" as Etl
database "analytics_db" as Analytics

Resident -> Pwa: Presiona Emergencia
Pwa -> Resident: Solicita confirmación
Resident -> Pwa: Confirma SOS
Pwa -> Api: POST /alerts
Api -> Db: Registra alerta activa
Api --> Pwa: Alerta creada
Pwa --> Resident: Mensaje y voz de confirmación
Caregiver -> Api: Consulta alertas activas
Api --> Caregiver: Devuelve alerta SOS
Caregiver -> Api: Marca atendida/resuelta
Api -> Db: Actualiza estado
Etl -> Db: Extrae métricas
Etl -> Analytics: Carga resumen diario
@enduml

